{
  "uid": "flagship-free-tier",
  "title": "Free tier watch",
  "description": "This month's usage against Google Cloud's free tier. The budget alerts email at ¥1,000 and ¥100; this shows how far away they are.",
  "tags": [
    "flagship",
    "cost"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now/M",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Flagship dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "flagship"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What's free each month",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The demo is sized to stay inside Google Cloud's free tier. Cloud Run's allowance is **per billing account**, so\nother projects on the same account share it. Firestore's is per day. Gauges turn orange at 50% and red at 80%.\n\n| | Free | Where it's counted |\n|---|---|---|\n| Cloud Run CPU | 180,000 vCPU-seconds | Only while handling requests (request-based billing) |\n| Cloud Run memory | 360,000 GiB-seconds | Store, dashboard and bots 0.5 GiB; Grafana 2 GiB |\n| Cloud Run requests | 2 million | Every request, bots included |\n| Firestore | 50,000 reads and 20,000 writes a day | The board document |\n| Cloud Logging | 50 GiB per project | Request logs and app logs |\n| Cloud Monitoring reads | 1 million time series per billing account | Every Grafana panel refresh. The console is free |\n"
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Cloud Run vCPU-seconds, this month",
      "description": "Every service and job here has 1 vCPU, so this is billable instance time.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "maxDataPoints": 50,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "(sum(increase(run_googleapis_com:container_billable_instance_time{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[$__interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(increase(run_googleapis_com:container_billable_instance_time{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_job\"}[$__interval])) or vector(0))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 90000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 144000
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 180000
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Cloud Run GiB-seconds, this month",
      "description": "Billable time × memory: 0.5 GiB for the store, dashboard and bots, 2 GiB for Grafana.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "stackdriver",
        "uid": "gcm"
      },
      "interval": "1h",
      "maxDataPoints": 50,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "stackdriver",
            "uid": "gcm"
          },
          "queryType": "promQL",
          "promQLQuery": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "expr": "0.5 * (sum(increase(run_googleapis_com:container_billable_instance_time{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=~\"flagship|flagship-control\"}[$__interval])) or vector(0)) + 2 * (sum(increase(run_googleapis_com:container_billable_instance_time{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",service_name=\"flagship-grafana\"}[$__interval])) or vector(0)) + 0.5 * (sum(increase(run_googleapis_com:container_billable_instance_time{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_job\"}[$__interval])) or vector(0))",
            "step": "$__interval"
          },
          "timeSeriesList": {
            "projectName": "__GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT__",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_NONE"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 180000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 288000
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 360000
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false
      },
      "id": 3
    },
